<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's Oct oil exports at 6.84 mln barrels.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's Oct oil exports at 6.84 mln barrels.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador exported 6.84 million barrels of crude oil in October, down from the 9.3 million shipped during the same month last year, the state oil Petroecuador said Monday.</p>
<p>The crude oil exported last month was down the 7.21 million barrels exported in September 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;There was a differential of two million barrels in September and October which we hope to transfer to November&quot;, said a Petroecuador spokesman.</p>
<p>--Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433</p>
</text>
